notes.content:
[list]
[*] Added Xbox gamepad support;
[*] Added gamepad vibration support (when connected via cable);
[*] Updated weapon firing/reloading animations;
[*] More realistic weapon behaviour. Bullets and magazines now fall to the ground;
[*] Added a new ending screen after completing the demo. Now features some story artwork from the game and a thank you from the team;
[*] New dinosaur tuning;
[*] General updates to improve user experience, especially UI navigation;
[*] Fixes of several bugs.
[/list]
